  "sampleChecks": {
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end1": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end1-line-1",
        "text": "Host: Welcome back to Nine to Five.",
        "startMs": 5080,
        "endMs": 6740
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end1-line-21",
        "text": "Suzy: It creates long-term problems for your body.",
        "startMs": 133600,
        "endMs": 136380
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end1-line-40",
        "text": "That’s all we have time for now, but tune in next week when we’ll be talking …",
        "startMs": 218140,
        "endMs": 228023
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end2": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end2-line-1",
        "text": "I love it when the power stops working.",
        "startMs": 5220,
        "endMs": 7820
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end2-line-17",
        "text": "Light pollution might not be as serious as other issues, but it does cause problems for the environment.",
        "startMs": 103020,
        "endMs": 109680
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-end2-line-32",
        "text": "Tune in next time when I’ll be …",
        "startMs": 207060,
        "endMs": 214413
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid1": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid1-line-1",
        "text": "Hi everyone.",
        "startMs": 4120,
        "endMs": 5640
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid1-line-18",
        "text": "So, what is it?",
        "startMs": 146720,
        "endMs": 149280
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid1-line-35",
        "text": "But these festivals are enormous fun for all generations and are a great alternative for people looking for something different.",
        "startMs": 258020,
        "endMs": 270655
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid2": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid2-line-1",
        "text": "Today I’m going to talk about an animal that has a great environmental impact – the beaver.",
        "startMs": 5880,
        "endMs": 12640
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid2-line-17",
        "text": "There were between 100 and 400 million beavers in North America before the Europeans arrived.",
        "startMs": 111820,
        "endMs": 119480
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-mid2-line-33",
        "text": "We just have to let nature’s engineers get on with their job.",
        "startMs": 237290,
        "endMs": 244715
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u01": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u01-line-1",
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming.",
        "startMs": 3420,
        "endMs": 5880
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u01-line-16",
        "text": "And a number of airlines let passengers travel with their pets to help with the anxiety of flying.",
        "startMs": 112880,
        "endMs": 119960
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u01-line-30",
        "text": "It doesn’t only benefit your welfare, it benefits the welfare of all the animals in the shelter, too.",
        "startMs": 220260,
        "endMs": 231184
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-1": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-1-line-1",
        "text": "Good morning.",
        "startMs": 3540,
        "endMs": 4860
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-1-line-15",
        "text": "Also, we can only use some areas of the ocean because most areas don’t get big waves, not big enough to produce the energy people need anyway.",
        "startMs": 101360,
        "endMs": 113640
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-1-line-29",
        "text": "However, using the ocean’s mechanical energy also has a lot of disadvantages: it is expensive, not very efficient and it can cause environmental problems.",
        "startMs": 220300,
        "endMs": 236669
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-2": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-2-line-1",
        "text": "We can only use some areas of ocean because most areas don’t get big waves, not big enough to produce the energy people need anyway.",
        "startMs": 6300,
        "endMs": 17000
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-2-line-3",
        "text": "Yet we can’t predict how they will move ...",
        "startMs": 30000,
        "endMs": 32380
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u02-2-line-4",
        "text": "This means that energy production is not reliable.",
        "startMs": 33410,
        "endMs": 40124
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u03": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u03-line-1",
        "text": "My name’s Freda Robinson, and I write a blog about travel trends.",
        "startMs": 3340,
        "endMs": 9840
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u03-line-17",
        "text": "What are the airlines trying to do about this?",
        "startMs": 108620,
        "endMs": 112020
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u03-line-33",
        "text": "If you want to check out more travel trends, then visit my blog at …",
        "startMs": 241540,
        "endMs": 251794
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u04": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u04-line-1",
        "text": "On this week’s podcast, I’ll be talking about a festival close to my heart: Dongzhi.",
        "startMs": 3580,
        "endMs": 9180
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u04-line-17",
        "text": "The traditional way of making them is to fill them with sesame seeds or red beans.",
        "startMs": 128450,
        "endMs": 134620
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u04-line-33",
        "text": "I don’t really believe in superstitions, but it doesn’t matter, it’s nice to see that some traditions aren’t dying out …",
        "startMs": 234160,
        "endMs": 246021
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u05": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u05-line-1",
        "text": "Host: On today’s show we’re going to talk about veganism.",
        "startMs": 3700,
        "endMs": 7840
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u05-line-18",
        "text": "However, one of the issues with being vegan is that you don’t get all the vitamins that you need, especially vitamin B12, which helps make blood and keeps the brain healthy.",
        "startMs": 118240,
        "endMs": 132360
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u05-line-34",
        "text": "Host: Maybe I’ll do that!",
        "startMs": 231680,
        "endMs": 238367
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u06": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u06-line-1",
        "text": "Hello and welcome to the lecture!",
        "startMs": 3360,
        "endMs": 6860
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u06-line-16",
        "text": "Next, let’s look at the X-ray.",
        "startMs": 127320,
        "endMs": 130520
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u06-line-31",
        "text": "OK, let’s look at a few more …",
        "startMs": 251720,
        "endMs": 257646
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u07": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u07-line-1",
        "text": "Interviewer: We’re back.",
        "startMs": 3380,
        "endMs": 4400
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u07-line-25",
        "text": "Here’s another thing.",
        "startMs": 109540,
        "endMs": 111300
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u07-line-49",
        "text": "I like shopping, but I am going to change my shopping habits from now on!",
        "startMs": 206380,
        "endMs": 214152
      }
    },
    "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u08": {
      "first": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u08-line-1",
        "text": "Thank you for coming tonight.",
        "startMs": 3620,
        "endMs": 5720
      },
      "middle": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u08-line-16",
        "text": "But it isn’t safe and it’s difficult to use.",
        "startMs": 95520,
        "endMs": 98880
      },
      "last": {
        "lineId": "track-unlock3workbookthirdedition-u08-line-30",
        "text": "I just don’t see the other options as better—for now anyway—and our relationship with cash, means it’ll be in our pockets for some time to come.",
        "startMs": 190140,
        "endMs": 203076
      }
    }
  }
